26. COMMUNICATION BOUNDARIES
==================================================

The following direct communication patterns are discouraged or prohibited unless explicitly defined by an architectural contract:

Core AI
→ External Provider

Core AI
→ Operating System

Core AI
→ Integration API

Router
→ Private Database

Router
→ Operating System

Memory
→ External Provider Selection

Knowledge
