==================================================

PRSL-AI controls coupling through:

1. Explicit interfaces.
2. Contract-based communication.
3. Internal-state isolation.
4. Provider abstraction.
5. Single authority.
6. Controlled dependency direction.
7. Capability boundaries.
8. Adapter layers.
9. Explicit permissions.
10. Verification.

